#: fonts.cpp:247
msgid ""
"This is a preview of the \"%1\" font. You can change this font by clicking "
"the \"Choose...\" button to the right."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je pregled \"%1\" fonta. Ovaj font možete promjeniti tako što "
"ćetekliknuti na \"Izaberi...\" dugme na desnoj strani."

#: fonts.cpp:248
msgid "Preview of the \"%1\" font"
msgstr "Pregled \"%1\" fonta."

#: fonts.cpp:254
msgid "Choose..."
msgstr "Izaberi..."

#: fonts.cpp:256
msgid "Click to select a font"
msgstr "Kliknite da izaberete font"

#: fonts.cpp:270
msgid "Adjust All Fonts..."
msgstr "Prilagodi sve fontove..."

#: fonts.cpp:271
msgid "Click to change all fonts"
msgstr "Kliknite da promjenite fontove"

#: fonts.cpp:276
msgid "Use A&nti-Aliasing for fonts"
msgstr "Koristi A&nti-Aliasing za fontove"

#: fonts.cpp:280
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDE will smooth the edges of curves in fonts and "
"some images."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ova opcija izabrana, KDE će izravnati (poravnati) fontove i neke "
"slike."

#: fonts.cpp:319
msgid ""
"<h1>Fonts</h1> This module allows you to choose which fonts will be used to "
"display text in KDE. You can select not only the font family (for example, "
"<em>helvetica</em> or <em>times</em>), but also the attributes that make up "
"a specific font (for example, <em>bold</em> style and <em>12 points</em> in "
"height.)"
"<p> Just click the \"Choose\" button that is next to the font you want to "
"change. You can ask KDE to try and apply font and color settings to non-KDE "
"applications as well. See the \"Style\" control module for more information."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Fontovi</h1> Ovaj modul omogućava da izaberete koji font ćete "
"koristiti za prikaz teksta u KDE-u. Možete izabrati ne samo familiju fonta "
"(npr. <em> helvetica</em> ili <em>times</em>, nego i atribute koje "
"uljepšavaju izabrani font (npr. <em>podebljani</em> stil i veličinu <em>"
"12 pointa</em> u visinu.)"
"<p>"
" Samo kliknite na dugme \"Izaberi\" koje se nalazi odmah pored fonta koji "
"želite promjeniti. Možete pitati KDE da pokuša da primjeni fontove i boje "
"na ne-KDE aplikacije. Za više informacija pogledajte kontrolni modul "
"\"Stil\" u meniju \"Teme\"."

#: fonts.cpp:370
msgid ""
"You have changed anti-aliasing related settings.\n"
"This change will only affect newly started applications."
msgstr ""
"Promjenili ste podešavanja vezana za anti-aliasing.\n"
"Ove promjene neće imati efekta dok ponovo ne pokrente KDE."

#: fonts.cpp:370
msgid "Anti-Aliasing Settings Changed"
msgstr "Anti-Aliasing postavke promjenjene"
